    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00038",
        "explanation": "Doctor provided an executable no-home-antibiotic and ward-confirmation plan.",
        "quote": "也不要自行用药，后天按通知去办住院"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
        "explanation": "Family obtained external ward confirmation and read back the no-home-use plan.",
        "quote": "至少我们不在家乱用药了"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
        "explanation": "Family read back escalation for major deterioration, although the doctor did not answer this final confirmation request.",
        "quote": "就直接急诊，不等后天"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode had a safe and traceable transition to the gynecology ward with a concrete plan not to use antibiotics at home. It remains only questionably open because the final family message asked for confirmation after the ward call and the tested doctor did not respond, and earlier safety-net/allergy clarification was incomplete.",
