          "quote": "主管医生当面核对后再用"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "Medication confusion was triggered and partly repaired, but the doctor did not directly ask about prior cephalosporin/penicillin allergy, severe reactions, already infused antibiotic timing/reactions, or liver-versus-allergy risk distinctions. Therefore this did not complete the beyond-minimum verification point.",
