        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor made the handoff more executable by specifying who to call, what to ask, and what to do if unreachable, without sacrificing the no-home-antibiotic safety boundary. The family used that plan and obtained confirmation from the ward, materially improving the trajectory.",
