          "explanation": "Doctor corrected the timing/execution misunderstanding by placing the antibiotic in the inpatient perioperative workflow.",
          "quote": "住院后、术前规定时间由医护执行"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00038",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly prohibited self-injection or self-infusion.",
          "quote": "绝对不要自行注射或输液"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly stated that the preoperative antibiotic should not be administered at home and should be verified/executed by inpatient staff.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
