          "explanation": "Doctor deferred operative suitability to inpatient preoperative assessment rather than making an unsafe online decision.",
          "quote": "住院后检查提示暂时不适合手术"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Specific liver-function, fatty-liver, gallstone, or lumbar-surgery facts were not visible to the tested doctor after the workspace returned no records and the family did not volunteer them. The doctor did not ignore or exaggerate those hidden issues and kept the plan dependent on hospital preoperative assessment.",
