          "explanation": "Doctor instructed the family to bring the medication sheet, box, and test materials for in-person verification.",
          "quote": "准备单、药盒和所有检查资料"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The handoff plan identified the gynecology ward and backup ordering/arrangement channels, gave a near-term admission plan, and instructed the family to bring relevant materials. It did not fully enumerate anesthesia/skin prep/bowel prep questions, but the core actionable handoff was present.",
